      "color": "#8B5CF6",
      "icon": "family",
      "desc": "Kids, parents and grandparents together — school, money, tasks, approvals and the conversations that hold it all together, even across distance.",
      "extra": "<div class=\"container split\">\n        <div class=\"split-text reveal\">\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\">Built for the whole family</span>\n          <h2>From your kids' childhood<br />to <span class=\"gradient-text\">their kids' childhood.</span></h2>\n          <p>QuantrolPlus isn't just for you. Your whole family shares one connected space — kids manage their own homework, activities and routines, while you stay informed without hovering.</p>\n          <ul class=\"check-list\">\n            <li>Kids learn real finance — assets, liabilities, equity — by living it</li>\n            <li>Coordinate as a family instead of everyone being disconnected</li>\n            <li>Approvals for permissions, purchases and decisions</li>\n            <li>Structured messaging for real-life family situations</li>\n          </ul>\n          <a href=\"#download\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Bring your family in →</a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"split-visual reveal\">\n          <div class=\"glass-card family-card\">\n            <img src=\"assets/images/logo-dark.jpeg\" alt=\"QuantrolPlus family ecosystem\" />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n",
