      "name": "Finance & Wealth",
      "color": "#F59E0B",
      "icon": "finance",
      "desc": "Wallets, assets, loans, budgets, tax and investments — a real balance sheet for your personal life and every business you run.",
      "extra": "<div class=\"container split reverse\">\n        <div class=\"split-text reveal\">\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\">Real financial clarity</span>\n          <h2>Not just income &amp; expense.<br />A complete <span class=\"gradient-text\">financial ecosystem.</span></h2>\n          <p>Most apps stop at simple tracking. QuantrolPlus gives you true balance sheets — assets, liabilities and equity — separately for personal life and every business you run.</p>\n          <div class=\"mini-stats\">\n            <div class=\"mini-stat\"><strong>Assets</strong><span>Track true value over time</span></div>\n            <div class=\"mini-stat\"><strong>Liabilities</strong><span>Loans, payables, obligations</span></div>\n            <div class=\"mini-stat\"><strong>Equity</strong><span>Your real net position</span></div>\n            <div class=\"mini-stat\"><strong>P&amp;L</strong><span>Per business, always clear</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"split-visual reveal\">\n          <div class=\"glass-card balance-card\">\n            <div class=\"bc-row bc-head\"><span>Net Worth</span><b class=\"pos\">₹ 42,80,000</b></div>\n            <div class=\"bc-bar\"><i style=\"--w:78%;--c:#22C55E\"></i></div>\n            <div class=\"bc-row\"><span>Assets</span><b class=\"pos\">₹ 61,50,000</b></div>\n            <div class=\"bc-bar\"><i style=\"--w:92%;--c:#3B82F6\"></i></div>\n            <div class=\"bc-row\"><span>Liabilities</span><b class=\"neg\">₹ 18,70,000</b></div>\n            <div class=\"bc-bar\"><i style=\"--w:34%;--c:#EF4444\"></i></div>\n            <div class=\"bc-tags\"><span>Personal</span><span>Business A</span><span>Business B</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n",
